# Loose raster dropped in the ROOT of art/ — the owner's own reference material,
# which is private and must never reach a public repo. Every sanctioned image in
# this game lives in a FOLDER (art/announcements/, art/reveals/, docs/screens/ —
# see the binary-asset exceptions in docs/09-conventions.md), so the root itself
# is always scratch. This is here because one `git add -A` was the only thing
# standing between a private file and a public deploy.
art/*.png
art/*.jpg
art/*.jpeg
art/*.webp
